    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Regarding that \"opportunist\" profile—can you be more specific? In a luxury setting, \"looking like they don't belong\" can be pretty subjective. Are there certain physical traits, styles of dress, or even specific demographics that my staff should be keeping a closer eye on so they know when to step up their vigilance?",
