      "content": "Focusing on specific physical traits or demographics is a dangerous and discriminatory practice. Instead, train your staff to look for behavioral red flags, such as overly aggressive browsing, attempting to touch merchandise without intent to purchase, or avoiding eye contact while lingering near high-value items. Vigilance should be based on suspicious *actions*, not on who the person appears to be.",
